ine":66,"column":1,"offset":1629},"end":{"line":66,"column":6,"offset":1634}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"take challenge","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":6,"offset":1634},"end":{"line":66,"column":22,"offset":1650}}},{"type":"text","value":" 按钮并将文件拖放到那里！","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":22,"offset":1650},"end":{"line":66,"column":35,"offset":1663}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":1,"offset":1629},"end":{"line":66,"column":35,"offset":1663}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":67,"column":1,"offset":1665}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Refund\" id=\"refund\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n现在我们可以转到 `refund` 指令，它位于 `refund.rs` 中，并将执行以下操作：\r\n- 关闭托管 PDA，并将其租金 lamports 返还给创建者。\r\n- 将金库中的全部 Token A 余额转回创建者，然后关闭金库账户。\r\n\r\n### 账户 \r\n\r\n在此上下文中需要的账户有：\r\n- `maker`：决定交换条款的用户\r\n- `escrow`：存储所有交换条款的账户\r\n- `mint_a`：`maker` 存入的代币\r\n- `vault`：与 `escrow` 和 `mint_a` 关联的代币账户，代币已存入其中\r\n- `maker_ata_a`：与 `maker` 和 `mint_a` 关联的代币账户，将从 `vault` 接收代币\r\n- `associated_token_program`：用于创建关联代币账户的关联代币程序\r\n- `token_program`：用于 CPI 转账的代币程序\r\n- `system_program`：用于创建 `Escrow` 的系统程序\r\n\r\n这次我们不会帮你创建 `Context`，所以请自己尝试完成！请确保使用正确的账户顺序，否则我们的测试将失败。\r\n\r\n### 逻辑 \r\n\r\n逻辑与 `take` 指令类似，但这次我们只是将代币从 `vault` 转移到 `maker_ata_a`，然后关闭现在已空的金库。\r\n\r\n这次轮到你自己学习如何完成了，所以我们不会告诉你解决方案是什么。\r\n\r\n请注意，一旦执行此操作，报价将失效，金库将被清空，创建者将其 Token A 和租金返还到他们的钱包中。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Entrypoint\" id=\"entrypoint\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n现在我们已经在不同的指令中创建了所有函数，终于可以将我们创建的所有函数填充到 `lib.rs` 中；像这样：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n#[program]\r\npub mod Kiloshift_anchor_escrow {\r\n    use super::*;\r\n\r\n    pub fn make(ctx: Context<Make>, seed: u64, receive: u64, amount: u64) -> Result<()> {\r\n        instructions::make::handler(ctx, seed, receive, amount)\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    pub fn take(ctx: Context<Take>) -> Result<()> {\r\n        instructions::take::handler(ctx)\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    pub fn refund(ctx: Context<Refund>) -> Result<()> {\r\n        instructions::refund::handler(ctx)\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Conclusion\" id=\"conclusion\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n现在您可以通过我们的单元测试测试您的程序并领取您的 NFT！\r\n\r\n首先，在终端中使用以下命令构建您的程序\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nanchor build\r\n```\r\n\r\n这将在您的 `target/deploy` 文件夹中直接生成一个 `.so` 文件。\r\n\r\n现在点击 `take challenge` 按钮并将文件拖放到那里！\r\n","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"rust","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"#[program]"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"pub"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" mod"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1;font-style:italic"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" Kiloshift_anchor_escrow"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" {"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"    use"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#BF9EEE;font-style:italic"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" super"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"::*"}]},{